  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">является дополнением к <a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sgjourney\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Stargate Journey</strong></a>, которое расширяет генерацию <strong>Звёздных врат</strong> в измерения других модов и добавляет несколько совместимых рецептов для некоторых <strong>технических модов</strong>.</span></h3><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Генерация Звёздных врат</strong> в различных измерениях, включая:</span></p><ol>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether</a></strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ad Astra (все измерения)</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmic-horizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cosmic Horizons (Все измерения)</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Twilight Forest</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Deeper and Darker</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/official-divinerpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">DivineRPG(Все измерения)</span></strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Undergarden</strong></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Eternal Starlight (1.21.1)</strong></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dive-into-the-abyss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Dive into the Abyss (1.21.1)</span></strong></a><br></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies (1.20.1)</a></strong></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-afterdark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Afterdark</a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/star-wars-planets-ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Планеты Звёздных войн (Ad Astra)</span></a><br><br></strong></span></span></h4>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stellaris (1.21.1)</a><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">Врата Нижнего мира и Конца теперь не закрыты!</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n</ol><p>✔ <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>некоторые рецепты совместимости с такими модами:</strong></span></p><ol>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">⚙ Create</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fd668e\"><a style=\"color:#fd668e\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>🛠 Tinker's Construct</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>🔥 Thermal Expansion</strong></a><br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Требуется:</span></strong><span style=\"color:#fff\"> <strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sgjourney\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stargate Journey</a></strong></span><br>🔹 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Совместимо с:</strong> <strong>Minecraft 1.20.1, 1.21.1<br><br></strong></span></li>\n</ol><h3><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">это дополнение к <a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sgjourney\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stargate Journey</a>, которое расширяет генерацию звёздных врат для других модов и добавляет несколько рецептов совместимости с некоторыми модами.<br><br></span></strong></h3><p>✔ <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Генерация звёздных врат</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">в различных измерениях, включая:</span></p><ol>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether</a></strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ad Astra (все измерения)</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmic-horizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cosmic Horizons (</strong></a><strong><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">все измерения</a></strong></span><strong>)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Twilight Forest</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Deeper and Darker</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/official-divinerpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">DivineRPG(</span></strong></a><strong><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">все измерения</a></strong></span><strong>)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Undergarden</strong></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Eternal Starlight(1.21.1)</strong></span></a></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dive-into-the-abyss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Dive into the Abyss(1.21.1)</span></strong></a><br></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies(1.20.1)</a></strong></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-afterdark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Afterdark</a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/star-wars-planets-ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Star Wars Planets(Ad Astra)</span></a><br><br></strong></span></span></h4>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stellaris(1.21.1)</a></strong></span></span></li>\n</ol><p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><br>Врата Ада и Нижнего мира открыты!</span></span></span></strong></span></p><p>✔ <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>некоторые рецепты совместимы с</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p><ol>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">⚙ Create</a></strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fd668e\"><a style=\"color:#fd668e\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>🛠 Tinker's Construct</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>🔥Thermal Expansion</strong></a></span></p>\n</li>\n</ol><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>В дополнение включён перевод </strong><strong>Stargate Journey</strong><strong> на португальский язык</strong></span></p><p>🔹 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Требуется:</strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> <strong><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sgjourney\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stargate Journey</a></strong></span></span><br>🔹 <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Совместимо с:</strong> <strong>Minecraft 1.20.1, 1.21.1</strong></span></p>",
